{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"prelim-2005-common-biology-16","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"biology","number":16,"points":null,"unitId":"circulation","unitLabel":"순환·혈액","topic":"혈관·림프관","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["circulation","immune"],"stem":"다음은혈관계와림프계에서일어나는현상이다.\n◦림프절에있는림프구는흉관을통해혈액으로유입된다.\n◦림프구는모세혈관벽을빠져나와조직간극을경유하여\n림프계로유입된다.\n◦림프관은작은창자에서혈관으로영양물질이이동하는\n통로가되기도한다.\n위현상에근거하여추정한내용으로옳은것을<보기>에서\n모두고른것은?\n<보기>\nㄱ. 한림프절에있는림프구는다른림프절이나지라로\n이동할수있다.\nㄴ. 인체는최소한의림프구수를유지하면서효율적으로\n운용된다.\nㄷ. 간을거친영양물질이전신으로운반될때림프계가\n사용된다.\nㄹ. 혈구세포는혈관계와림프계사이를자유로이이동한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":746,"height":257,"region":0,"bbox":[14.111,27.316,298.4,102.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t002","t003","t004","t005","t006"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-common-biology-16/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":744,"height":362,"region":0,"bbox":[14.111,186.916,297.6,144.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-common-biology-16/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":4,"sourceRect":[373.089,599.884,690.55,958.892],"width":317.462,"height":359.008,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[14.111,27.316,298.4,102.8],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.111,186.916,297.6,144.8],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"16. 다음은혈관계와림프계에서일어나는현상이다.","bbox":[5.0,5